mes skill cost, grants Ibuki (Swimsuit) 3 Seashells. Upon gaining 12 Seashells, they will become a Seashell Flower and Ibuki (Swimsuit) will no longer gain any more Seashells.","english":"Designates up to two allied Strikers as Friends.\nChanges this skill to \"Which One Should I Choose?\" for the remainder of the battle and immediately redraws the EX Skill.\nWhenever a Friend consumes skill cost, grants Ibuki (Swimsuit) 3 Seashells. Upon gaining 12 Seashells, they will become a Seashell Flower and Ibuki (Swimsuit) will no longer gain any more Seashells."},{"collection":"skillTables","id":"ba-Ex-CH0347Ex02","field":"name","originalEnglish":"どれがいいかな？","english":"Which One Should I Choose?"},{"collection":"skillTables","id":"ba-Public","field":"name","originalEnglish":"イブキも手伝う！","english":"Ibuki Will Help Too!"},{"collection":"skillTables","id":"ba-Public","field":"descriptionTemplate","originalEnglish":"Every 30s after activating \"イブキのお友達！\", grants a effect to each Friend for 20s depending on their role.\nTank: Increases DEF by {1}.\nDealer: Increases Crit DMG by {2}.\nSupporter: Grants HP Regen, restoring HP by {3} every 4s.\nHealer: Increases Healing by {1}.\nIf both Friends have the same role, the effects are doubled.\nIf Ibuki (Swimsuit) has a Seashell Flower, the duration of the effect is increased to 25s.","english":"Every 30s after activating \"Ibuki's Friends!\", grants a effect to each Friend for 20s depending on their role.\nTank: Increases DEF by {1}.\nDealer: Increases Crit DMG by {2}.\nSupporter: Grants HP Regen, restoring HP by {3} every 4s.\nHealer: Increases Healing by {1}.\nIf both Friends have the same role, the effects are doubled.\nIf Ibuki (Swimsuit) has a Seashell Flower, the duration of the effect is increased to 25s."},{"collection":"skillTables","id":"ba-Passive","field":"name","originalEnglish":"万魔殿の良心","english":"The Conscience of Pandemonium"},{"collection":"skillTables","id":"ba-ExtraPassive","field":"name","originalEnglish":"ちびっこ天才ハカセ"